	Thanks for all the replies. My original question was 
	compatibility between the tape drives TLZ04  and TLZ06 
	while using the "tar" command (I have paraphased the
	question).

	I got many replies all have them implying the following
	things (thanks a bunch, you know who you are):

	1) TLZ04 does NOT accept 90M tapes.
	
	2) To "tar" and "untar" between the two tape drives , I
	   should be using the "/dev/rmt0l" which is the
	   uncompressed and low densitty mode, instead of the
	   default "/dev/rmt0h".

