Subject: SUMMARY: HSZ disk replacement
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=96078608810229

  
The commands to replace an HSZ disk that uses Raid 0+1 were the following:
   set mirrorset NOPOLICY
   set mirrorset REMOVE=diskxxx
   { now do a warm swap of the disk }
   set mirrorset REPLACE=diskxxx
   
   After the disk are synced up, the replacement policy should be set 
   back to what it was originally.

